{"tool_name":"2d-spots-counting-using-knime","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>These two KNIME workflow solutions are similar: first one detects nuclei and spots inside the nuclei without taking care of surrounding regions, i.e. mitochondria. The second one provides the full solution including spots in mitochondria.</p>\n\n<p>see section 2.4 for KNIME workflow. Section 2.3 is also available, using Fiji.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Sample image: <a href=\"http://cellnetmcweb.bioquant.uni-heidelberg.de/image-analysis/2ndBIAWorkshop_Fiji-KNIME/materials/KNIME/RawData/RawData_CountSpots-Nuclei/\">hela</a><a href=\"http://cellnetmcweb.bioquant.uni-heidelberg.de/image-analysis/2ndBIAWorkshop_Fiji-KNIME/materials/KNIME/RawData/RawData_CountSpots-Nuclei/\">-cells.tif (674k x 3)</a></p>","summary":"","value":"<p>These two KNIME workflow solutions are similar: first one detects nuclei and spots inside the nuclei without taking care of surrounding regions, i.e. mitochondria. The second one provides the full solution including spots in mitochondria.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>see section 2.4 for KNIME workflow. Section 2.3 is also available, using Fiji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sample image: <a href=\"http://cellnetmcweb.bioquant.uni-heidelberg.de/image-analysis/2ndBIAWorkshop_Fiji-KNIME/materials/KNIME/RawData/RawData_CountSpots-Nuclei/\">hela</a><a href=\"http://cellnetmcweb.bioquant.uni-heidelberg.de/image-analysis/2ndBIAWorkshop_Fiji-KNIME/materials/KNIME/RawData/RawData_CountSpots-Nuclei/\">-cells.tif (674k x 3)</a></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-14T21:26:17+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T11:35:33+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1505239408,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_autho